     "<div dir=\"ltr\">This is fine, it&#39;s how exploratory factor analysis models are identified (hence, why they need rotation post-estimation). </div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Phil</span><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
